  (c) Independent Forking or Derivative Works: Maintain or use a fork for independent
      or diverging development, or modify, adapt, translate, or create derivative
      works, clones, or substantially similar games based on the Software;
  (d) Asset or Code Extraction: Extract, copy, or reuse any code modules, architecture,
      shaders, algorithms, 3D models, textures, level data, or UI designs in any other
